#   fetch_timing_info - Fetch::Infrastructure::FetchTimingInfo: a fetch's timestamps, final
#   connection timing info, server-timing headers and render-blocking flag
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Infrastructure/FetchTimingInfo.cpp (lines 17-73) with
#       the inline accessors of FetchTimingInfo.h (lines 31-66), in the header's order.
#       ConnectionTimingInfo.h is a plain struct (types_connection_timing_info).
